{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"santizhu-e-sr-psz-jizhi-critique","title":"裴松之评纪陟护风寒之譬未足称能","accounts":[{"id":"santizhu-a-3ccc0f46f296951e4de9","label":"裴松之按语","text":"臣松之以为人有八尺之体靡不受患防护风寒岂唯数处，取譬若此未足称能；若曰譬如金城万雉所急防者四门，方陟此对不犹愈乎","evidence":["santizhu-q-426ad2dfa5da7a191d12"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0003","role":"评纪陟答辞","evidence":["santizhu-q-426ad2dfa5da7a191d12"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"未由相邻段落推算纪年；原文时间表达保留在来源引句中。","evidence":["santizhu-q-426ad2dfa5da7a191d12"]},"ordering_evidence":"santizhu-q-426ad2dfa5da7a191d12","source_order":[48,345,0],"order":8702}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0003","name":"裴松之","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"santizhu-q-426ad2dfa5da7a191d12","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-c3ab5e397a096c66366d","layer":"pei","quote":"臣松之以为：人有八尺之体，靡不受患；防护风寒，岂唯数处？取譬若此，未足称能。若曰“譬如金城万雉，所急防者四门而已”。方陟此对，不犹愈乎！","attribution":"裴松之按语","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":344,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-3e27b22ad0ec8aa70587","start":422,"end":490,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
